Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:51:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] gfxstream: optionally reset fences without waiting

debug.velox.async_fence_reset=1 (not with the confirmed fence cache): the
fence reset is applied by the host in sequence-number order before any later
submit, status query or wait, and its status is read with the next reply.

